# TypeScript build artifacts
*.tsbuildinfo
next-env.d.ts
.vercel
.env*

# Vendored Claude Code skill content (~1.4MB), plus the symlinks pointing into
# it. Both are restored by the skill installer from skills-lock.json, which is
# committed — tracking a symlink to an ignored directory just dangles on clone.
.agents/
.claude/skills/

# Screenshot/dev-login scratch. `.dev-login-token` is a live bearer credential
# for a host account (scripts/dev-login-token.ts); the screenshot directories
# are throwaway capture output.
#
# Both spellings, deliberately. The capture output has landed in `docs/`
# before, and 39 MB of PNGs committed there is not undone by deleting them in
# a later commit — git keeps every blob it has been told about, so a clone
# carries them forever. Ignoring the path is the only thing that actually
# prevents it.
.dev-login-token
.screenshots/
docs/screenshots/
